{
    "word": "hadron",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                "word": "hadron",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "40393762-bd4d-4970-b094-ffde2034e7b0",
                        "entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hadrons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                        "entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A composite particle that comprises two or more quarks held together by the strong force and (consequently) can interact with other particles via said force; a meson or a baryon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "particle"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f6f8488-b7e6-42f1-985f-551596ef27b9",
                                "sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                                "text": "The weak decays of b hadrons are dominated by the spectator model process whereby the b quark decays to a c quark (or occasionally a u quark) with the emission of an external W, while the non-b antiquark or diquark acts simply as a passive spectator to the decay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e278d13-660b-4c6a-a40e-7caf13de051c",
                                "sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                                "text": "One can use the lattice simulations, which do represent the rigorous consequences of non-perturbative QCD, as guidance for models of hadron structure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5a7769d-826f-44ed-9435-cb55eda075d3",
                                "sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                                "text": "And hence colour, which was initially an ad hoc concept, later turned out to be an empirically confirmed reality of hadrons."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffc0be81-2f15-497e-8dd9-dfc20c2eb4b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "source_sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                        "source_sense_description": "composite particle composed of quarks",
                        "target_lang_word": "hadron",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hadron",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "729af313-2397-3528-a035-9cfe9f33562d",
                                        "entry_id": "fe350523-0d00-358a-8c7a-985919b86f7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "subatomární částice, která reaguje na silnou interakci"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6d145da-28c1-4304-8b4d-39c880ddb33d",
                                                "sense_id": "729af313-2397-3528-a035-9cfe9f33562d",
                                                "text": "Vědci z experimentu LHCb v CERNu představili objev nové částice Tcc+. Jedná se o tetrakvark – exotický hadron obsahující dva kvarky a dva antikvarky."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0d441a3-7f61-40e3-9bfe-3c24afaaabe0",
                        "source_entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "source_sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                        "source_sense_description": "composite particle composed of quarks",
                        "target_lang_word": "hadron",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hadron",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8300b4c9-2dbd-34f2-9390-3076017d9ca6",
                                        "entry_id": "020c1029-c257-38ff-9c96-836696aa4ac4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een elementair deeltje dat zelf uit quarks bestaat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "deeltjesfysica"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10080e27-20da-4b60-bc23-b6d8c279f9a3",
                                                "sense_id": "8300b4c9-2dbd-34f2-9390-3076017d9ca6",
                                                "text": "Volgens WMAP bestaat vier procent van de massa van het heelal uit hadronen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09fc7ae0-e524-4d2a-bbba-1aa3fe636cea",
                                                "sense_id": "8300b4c9-2dbd-34f2-9390-3076017d9ca6",
                                                "text": "Nu hebben deeltjesfysicus Benjamin Dönigus van de Goethe-universiteit Frankfurt in Duitsland en zijn collega’s van de Large Hadron Collider (LHC) bij CERN in Genève de lat nog hoger gelegd. Ze hebben een nog zwaardere antimateriekern gemaakt: antihyperhelium-4."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8033d32-0046-40c2-b34c-c60b1d00397b",
                        "source_entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "source_sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
                        "source_sense_description": "composite particle composed of quarks",
                        "target_lang_word": "hadron",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hadron",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "074473be-7988-32dc-b3d3-5d4d3c63459f",
                                        "entry_id": "82f3f2d8-43cf-3ed8-8f06-5fc5ae011bd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Particule sensible à l’interaction forte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6faeecca-f786-4bf4-b476-b3ad4a358c4b",
                                                "sense_id": "074473be-7988-32dc-b3d3-5d4d3c63459f",
                                                "text": "Les protons sont des hadrons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8104eea1-2c20-466a-9a60-2be8902af8ee",
                                                "sense_id": "074473be-7988-32dc-b3d3-5d4d3c63459f",
                                                "text": "Les raisons des fins du monde étaient diverses […] la Terre disparaissait dans un trou noir créé par le collisionneur de hadrons ; la fin abrupte du champ magnétique faisait pénétrer le vent solaire dans l’atmosphère ; l’atmosphère terrestre fuyait brutalement vers l’espace et les océans s’asséchaient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "18a7ba5f-12bb-4af7-8ce7-538c5603a1e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "148bb643-d7dd-3062-bf14-124e15e35301",
                        "source_sense_id": "8dc8d811-dddc-326d-b771-8d757bc6d63d",
